        "id": "pesto-orzo-5",
        "path": "media/pesto-orzo-5-sketch.webp",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of same two-handled saucepan of sauced creamy orzo",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the HelloFresh recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-6",
      "number": 6,
      "heading": "Finish and serve",
      "blocks": [
        "Rest the cooked chicken on a board for a couple of minutes, then slice thinly.",
        "Divide the orzo between bowls and top with sliced chicken. For anyone who wants them, add the sliced spring onion and pumpkin seeds."
      ],
